%% Expense tracker: OAuth browser return path (login_code exchange).
%% Paste into https://mermaid.live or use a Mermaid preview in the editor.
%% Full narrative: ../ARCHITECTURE_DIAGRAM.md section 7.

sequenceDiagram
  participant Browser
  participant Edge as Vite or nginx
  participant API as Express API
  participant IdP as Identity provider
  participant PG as PostgreSQL

  Browser->>Edge: GET /api/auth/oauth/google
  Edge->>API: forward /api
  API-->>Browser: 302 to IdP authorize
  Browser->>IdP: user consents
  IdP-->>Browser: 302 to /api/auth/oauth/google/callback?code&state
  Browser->>Edge: GET callback
  Edge->>API: forward
  API->>IdP: exchange code for tokens + load profile
  API->>PG: find or create user + oauth_identities
  API->>API: issue JWT, store one-time login_code
  API-->>Browser: 302 to /oauth/callback?login_code=...
  Browser->>Edge: POST /api/auth/oauth/login-code
  Edge->>API: forward
  API-->>Browser: 200 JSON token and user
  Note over Browser: SPA stores session; subsequent calls use Authorization Bearer
